; Fixture of tools/build_rooms.py: the shop template. The test compiles it as the pocket ow_1_2#shop (under the
; file name ow_1_2__shop.room). Stock is shop S1 of the graph: an ember (8 brass) and a pot bundle (12 brass).
; The stock sits 22 px south of its pedestal (y = 96r + 70), the convention of pickups on a pedestal.
room ow_1_2#shop
terrain Tilly's lamp stall: stone counter, lanterns
grid
####################
#..................#
#..................#
#..................#
#..................#
#..................#
#..................#
#..................#
#..................#
####################
prop pedestal 5,3
prop pedestal 14,3
shop S1 ember @528,358
shop S1 pot_bundle @1392,358 id=pot_s1
door ow_1_2 FromPocket 9,8
spawn Inside 9,6
